== Overview ==
The {{Mythic|Futuristic Juggernaut}} is a [[Mythic]] unit that was added in the '''[[Futuristic Update]]'''. This unit also has a [[Splash]] ability.

== Appearance ==
The '''Futuristic Juggernaut''' is a unit from the [[Toilets (Units)|Toilets]] species. It appears as a toilet with 2 arms and wears a strong steel helmet. Its eyes glow red, and on both hands, it has 4 small guns, with a red laser in the center of each hand.

== Obtainment ==
You can obtain the '''Futuristic Juggernaut''' from the [[Futuristic Crate]], which has an '''80% chance''' of dropping. You can also acquire this unit by [[trading]] with other players, purchasing it with [[gems]] in the [[marketplace]], or receiving it from other players via the [[Post Office|post office]].

