== Strategy ==

* Since this unit has a [[Splash]] attack ability, you can place it anywhere you like.
** We recommend placing them in groups for the best attack efficiency.
* Its upgrade cost is very low, making it a good option to use.
* You can combo this unit with others that have different abilities, such as [[Sub-Traits|AoE]] or [[Piercing]].
* Although its overall stats aren't very high, it is still usable in the early to mid-game waves.

== Trivia ==

* This unit is the easiest to obtain from the [[Futuristic Crate]].
* This unit has no connection to the main storyline at all.

